title: Pepper
---
<<wait 0.1>>
<<if $day == 1>>
    <<jump Pepper_Day1>>
<<elseif $day == 2>>
    <<jump Pepper_Day2>>
<<elseif $day == 3>>
    <<jump Pepper_Day3>>
<<elseif $day == 4>>
    <<jump Pepper_Day4>>
<<elseif $day == 5>>
    <<jump Pepper_Day5>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Pepper_Day1
---
Pepper: This is way better than sitting in class.
<<if $talkedToPepper == false>>
    <<set $talkedToPepper = true>>
    <<set $peopleMet = $peopleMet + 1>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Pepper_Day2
---
Pepper: I saw a wolf on the peaks!... just kidding. 
===

title: Pepper_Day3
---
<<if $hasFished == false>>
    Pepper: You need to catch a fish before you can cook!
<<elseif $hasFished == true>>
    Pepper: I'm sooo hungry! I hope you caught lots of fish, but there's plenty of other ingredients for you to use if you didn't. 
        -> Ernest: I'm ready to cook!
            <<set $playCooking = true>>
            <<if $hasCooked == false>>
                <<set $hasCooked = true>>
            <<endif>>
        -> Ernest: I'm not ready yet.
<<endif>>
===

title: Pepper_Day4
---
Pepper: Are you here to make sandwiches?
    -> Ernest: Yep!
        <<set $playCooking = true>>
    -> Ernest: No, sorry
        Pepper: All good
===

title: Pepper_Day5
---
Pepper: You know what would be really cool, if we had sandwiches for the trip back. 
    -> Ernest: Yeah, I'll make some 
        Pepper: OMG Thank you so much! 
        <<set $playCooking = true>>
    -> Ernest: Sorry, I have some more things I need to do. 
        Pepper: Ohh, maybe later then. 
===